{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://heartsandbonesrescue.org/register-to-adopt","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Collie, Border","breed_primary":"Collie, Border","description_text":"Macaron is a 1-year-old mixed breed who weighs around 52 lbs, though her foster has taken to calling her Boots thanks to the four adorable white paws that stand out against her dark coat.\n\nShe’s sweet, friendly, great with other dogs, and very into people. Macaron warmed up to her foster almost immediately and wasted no time making herself comfortable, especially if cuddling was involved. She’s affectionate, easy to love, and happiest when she gets to be close to her people.\n\nShe’s also crate-trained and making great progress with house-training. Between the cute little boots, the cuddles, and her social personality, Macaron has a lot going for her.\n\nRegistered adopters interested in Macaron can email adopt@hbrdogs.com for more info. If you're not registered yet, do it today at hbrdogs.com.","detail_url":"https://new.shelterluv.com/embed/animal/HBR-A-123481","id":"a6be8a83793a8f20e161aa64f08d5988","image_urls":["https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/1b7d24a40e8368db83ff1322e1dfa663/86b6aad6fbaecf28f0d1c8c1818e0d15.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/be5223a827924049e8da34d86910a542/75a05ab3b9735e3ae1dc222c168d04f0.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/9176bc818f0e31cadfb678fadc7a7d04/4d0dcc78f8776ffb2a698fd2431dde36.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/598653d0614044334e851d2407f4b625/408db56d1895b393ffae154c51930478.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/a8cf93f5ac285dcbf43622a93ab8512d/fe0047d8abe9104d76f1ea7459c1f383.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/0528049d23f032a4d132e4f8721bca88/939c8d5c2c386c4c049cb9abeb844d6d.jpg","https://new-s3.shelterluv.com/profile-pictures/206b87ab1f37cc8a73c1903922b33008/61f2413e2f13de27a851a669d3a9aec4.jpg","https://new-s3.s